ng at KIT\nStart\nCareer\nWorking at KIT\nWorking at KIT\nWork Culture\nDiversity\nBenefits\nWorking Environment\nKIT for International Talent\nGet Started\nStart\nCareer\nGet Started\nGet Started\nScience\nInfrastructure\nAdministration\nVocational Training and Cooperative Study Programs\nStudents\nApplication Process\nStart\nCareer\nApplication Process\nApplication Process\nFAQ\nJobs\nStartpage\nHome\nPlain Language\nLegals\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nSitemap\nIntranet\nsearch\nsearch\nStartpage\nResearch\nYoung Scientists\nDoctorate\nKarlsruhe Institute of Technology\nKIT\nTopics\nStudies\nResearch\nInnovation\nCareer\nResearch\nTopics\nExcellence\nHelmholtz Programs\nResearch Networks\nYoung Scientists\nResearch Infrastructures\nSecurity Research\nScientific Integrity\nYoung Scientists\nDoctorate\nPostdoc Phase\nPaths to Professorship\nDoctorate\nDoing a Doctorate at KIT\nDoctoral Programs\nDoctorate\nAre you interested in pursuing a doctorate at KIT? We\u2019ll guide you every step of the way.\nAt KIT, a university of excellence with unique research infrastructures, you\u2019ll find an open, creative, and international environment where you can freely develop your research ideas. Through both basic and applied research, we actively contribute to shaping a sustainable and livable future.\nYour journey is our focus: We place great importance on supporting early-career researchers. That is why we provide you with academic, personal, and organizational support throughout your entire doctorate. We support you not only in deepening your knowledge but also in your individual career development \u2013 tailored to your goals, talents, and life situation.\nKarlsruhe House of Young Scientists (KHYS) is the central point of contact for early-career researchers at KIT and provides support and information right from the start regarding:\nSupervision and funding\nAdmission requirements\nTraining and career development\nAny questions? The KHYS team is happy to help!\nChiar